.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_WYR_LetterToSons</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_LetterToSons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_LetterToSons\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">0256dd45-5b6c-437d-9057-9cf516302451</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0256dd45-5b6c-437d-9057-9cf516302451\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0256dd45-5b6c-437d-9057-9cf516302451\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the abandoned house behind <a href=\"/wiki/Arfur%27s_Mansion\" title=\"Arfur's Mansion\">Arfur's Mansion</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;24&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-55</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Beloved Sons,\n</p><p><br>\nI'm not waiting for the Absolute cultists to catch me - I'm heading for the tall timber. Look for me at the fishing hole where we caught that gar.\n</p><p><br>\nIt isn't much, but I left you all the gold, I'll manage without it. Now gear up and get out before it's too late. Remember your training, and Casteve, don't drag your feet, you leave too obvious a trail.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202636\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1349/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23666/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5825/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935589/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.960      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   48.960      1 -total\n 48.32%   23.657      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.88%   21.484     15 Template:Trim\n 26.62%   13.035      2 Template:Uid\n 20.25%    9.916      1 Template:Main_only\n 15.69%    7.683      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.34%    5.064      1 Template:PageSeo\n  9.91%    4.853      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.71%    4.266      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:44617-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202636 and revision id 364853. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}